  "description": "Get ready for a brand-new puzzle battle experience that blends speed and strategy, now on Nintendo Switch™!\n\nOne wrong move can turn the tables, but a flash of inspiration can change everything!\nEnjoy intense, edge-of-your-seat matches where the outcome isn't decided until the very end!\n\nCustomize the game to your liking with detailed settings such as stage size, music, time limits, and player colors!\n\nWith a Joy-Con™ controller for each player, you can challenge a friend to a serious one-on-one showdown!\n\n《Rules》\nTake turns placing blocks and connect lines vertically or horizontally!\nWhen a line is completed, all blocks on that line disappear!\nEarn points based on the number of your opponent's blocks removed!\nThe first player to reach the target score wins!\n\n[Challenge Mode]\nBattle against the CPU under special rules!\nEach victory increases the difficulty, putting your thinking skills and speed to the test.\nPush your limits and see how far you can go!\n\n[Battle Mode]\nFace off in intense one-on-one matches against the CPU or friends!\nAdjust the settings and enjoy battles tailored to your preferences!\n\n[Online Mode]\nCompete in real-time against players from around the world!\nJump into Quick Matches that affect your rating, or enjoy casual Room Matches!\nTest your strategy against skilled competitors nationwide!",
